          · exact t3Facet13_box9 Y Z (by linarith) (by linarith) (by linarith) (by linarith)
      · by_cases h3 : Z ≤ (1 / 4 : ℝ)
        · exact t3Facet13_box3 Y Z (by linarith) (by linarith) (by linarith) (by linarith)
        · exact t3Facet13_box4 Y Z (by linarith) (by linarith) (by linarith) (by linarith)
